<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">RRK37.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">HAGAI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">HAGAI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Enaama y'okwombeka hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:24">Ezr 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:1">5:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 5:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Dario, omu kwezi kwa mukaaga, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Zerubabeeli, mwene Shealutieli, omutegyeki wa Yuda, n'ahari Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="HAG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Abantu aba nibagira bati: Obunaku bw'okugaruka kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA tibukahikire. <verse eid="HAG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai nikigira kiti: <verse eid="HAG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2">2 Sam 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:11">Isa 64:11</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu obu nibwo bunaku obu mushemereire kuraara omu maju gaanyu agashwekirwe embaaho omunda, haza enju egi ekaguma eri omushaka? <verse eid="HAG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Muteekateekye aha mitwarize yaanyu. <verse eid="HAG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:10">Hos 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:15">Mik 6:15</ref>. </char></note> Mukabiba bingi, mwagyesha bikye; nimurya kwonka timurikuhaaga; nimunywa, kwonka timurikuhwa iriho; nimujwara, kwonka timurikutagatirwa; kandi n'orikukorera ebihembo, naabikorera kubibiika omu nshaho efumukire.<verse eid="HAG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Muteekateekye aha mitwarize yaanyu. <verse eid="HAG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:13">Zab 132:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 132:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Mwinamukye omu bibungo, mureete ebiti, mwombekye egyo nju, mbone kugishemerererwa n'okugihimbisizibwamu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="HAG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />Mukagira amatsiko g'okutunga bingi, mbwenu reeba, bibaire bikye; kandi ku mubireetsire omuka, naabihuuha, byatuntumuka. Nimugira ngu ekyo kireetsirwe ki? Nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikubuuza. Kireetsirwe enju yangye kuguma eri omushaka, haza buri muntu omuriimwe akahugira aha kwombeka eye. <verse eid="HAG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:35">1 Bag 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:24">Yer 5:24</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo eiguru ahaiguru yaanyu riimiire orume ahabwanyu, n'ensi ekanga kweza, <verse eid="HAG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:1">2 Bag 8:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:16">Zab 105:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 128:2">128:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:17">Hag 2:17</ref>. </char></note> naanye nkareeta omushana mwingi omu nsi n'aha bibungo, aha mbibo, ahari viinyo, aha majuta, aha birikumera omu itaka byona, aha bantu, aha matungo n'aha bi barikuhendekyera byona.<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Bwanyima Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli, na Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru n'abantu boona abaatsigaireho, baayorobera eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo n'ebigambo bya nabi Hagai, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo yaamutumire; kandi abantu boona baatiina MUKAMA. <verse eid="HAG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:1">Mal 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:7">2:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">3:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hagai, entumwa ya MUKAMA, yaagambira abantu ebi MUKAMA amutumire, naagira ati: MUKAMA naagira ati: Ndi hamwe naimwe. <verse eid="HAG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1">Ezr 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:8">5:8</ref>. </char></note> Atyo MUKAMA yaimutsya omutima gwa Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli omutegyeki wa Yuda, n'ogwa Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, n'ey'abantu boona abaatsigaireho, baija, baatandika kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga waabo, <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">Hag 1:1</ref>. </char></note> aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina omuri okwo kwezi kwa mukaaga.<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hagai okugamba aha kitiinisa kya hekalu ensya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />Omuri ogwo mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Dario, omu kwezi kwa mushanju, aha kiro kyakwo ekya makumi abiri na kimwe, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />Gambira Zerubabeeli, mwene Shealutieli na Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru n'abantu boona abatsigaireho oti: <verse eid="HAG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:12">Ezr 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zek 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Beitu omuriimwe harimu otsigaireho owaareebire ekitiinisa eki enju egi yaabaire eine obunyakare? Mbwenu hati nimugireeba muta? Ti busha omu maisho gaanyu? <verse eid="HAG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:9">Zek 8:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati guma, iwe Zerubabeeli; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira; naiwe Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, guma; kandi naimwe abantu b'omuri egi nsi mwena, mugume, kandi mukore; ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naimwe; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira, <verse eid="HAG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:45">Kur 29:45</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:20">Neh 9:20</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:13">Zek 8:13</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 8:15">15</ref>. </char></note> nk'eki naaragaine naimwe, obu mwaruga Misri, oku kiri. Omwoyo wangye atuura omuriimwe, mutatiina. <verse eid="HAG 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:26">Heb 12:26</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: omu kaanya kakye niinyija kugaruka ntengyetse eiguru n'ensi, enyanja n'eitaka; <verse eid="HAG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa 52:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:9">60:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:17">17</ref>. </char></note> kandi ndyatengyetsa amahanga goona, eitungo ry'ago mahanga goona riije, n'egi nju ngiijuze ekitiinisa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="HAG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:14">1 Bus 29:14</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 29:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Efeeza n'ezangye, ezaabu nazo n'ezangye; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="HAG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />Ekitiinisa ky'egi nju ekya bwanyima kiryakira ekyayo eky'okubanza; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira; kandi omuri ogu myanya nimwo ndiheera obusingye; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />Kandi aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina omu kwezi kwa mwenda omuri ogwo mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Dario, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 10:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Buuza abanyamurwa ekibuuzo eki oti: <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />Omuntu ku yaakutwarira enyama eyeziibwe omu kicweka kya ifo eky'ekanzu ye, yaakikoza aha mugaati, nari aha kicumbe, nari omuri viinyo nari omu majuta nari aha by'okurya by'omuringo gwona, kikaaba ekirikwera? Abanyamurwa baagarukamu bati: Ngaaha. <verse eid="HAG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:4">Lev 22:4</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 22:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:22">Kub 19:22</ref>. </char></note> Hagai yaagaruka yaababuuza ati: Omuntu orikushiishwa okukora aha mutumbi, ku yaakukora aha kintu kimwe ahari ebyo, kikaaba ekitashemeire? Abanyamurwa baagarukamu bati: Eego, kikaaba ekitashemeire. <verse eid="HAG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:6">Isa 64:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hagai yaagira ati: MUKAMA naagira ati: Kandi nikwo kiri n'omu maisho gangye ahari aba bantu n'ahari eri ihanga; kandi nikwo kiri n'aha murimo gwona ogu barikukoresa emikono yaabo; kandi n'eki barikuhongyerayo kyona kisiisikaire. <verse eid="HAG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />Mbwenu nimbeeshengyereza, muteekateekye ebirikwija kubaho okwiha hati. Obu eibaare ryona ryabaire ritakatairwe ha rindi omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA, bikabasusira ki? <verse eid="HAG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />Obu omuntu yaabaire ahika aha kirundo ky'encuro makumi abiri, akashangamu ikumi ryonka; kandi obu omuntu yaabaire ahika aha bwato bwa viinyo kutahamu enjoga makumi ataano, akashanga ziri makumi abiri zonka. <verse eid="HAG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:6">Amo 4:6</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 4:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:9">Hag 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Nkabateeza okubabuka, okusya-nyamwenga n'orubaare, kwonka nabwo timurangarukiire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="HAG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:10">Ezr 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:9">Zek 8:9</ref>. </char></note> Nimbeeshengyereza muteekateekye okwiha hati, aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina eky'okwezi kwa mwenda n'omu biro ebirikwija. Okwiha aha izooba eri omusingi gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA gwateereirweho, muteekateekye. <verse eid="HAG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:14">Yoel 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:12">Zek 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Embibo zikiri omu bitara? Emizaabibu, emitiini, emikomamahanga n'emizeituuni nibikyera busha? Okwiha eri izooba niinyija kubaha omugisha.<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija ahari Hagai obwa kabiri aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina ky'okwo kwezi nikigira kiti: <verse eid="HAG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:6">Zek 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Zerubabeeli omutegyeki wa Yuda noogira oti: Niinyija kutengyetsa eiguru n'ensi, <verse eid="HAG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:10">Mik 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:13">Zek 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:7">Mat 24:7</ref>. </char></note> njuumikye ekitebe ky'obugabe; kandi niinyija kumaraho amaani g'obugabe bw'amahanga, njuumikye ebigaari by'orugamba n'abarikubigyenderamu; biryagwa ahansi, buri muntu aitwe rurara ya mugyenzi we. <verse eid="HAG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:10">Isa 43:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:24">Yer 22:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Eryo izooba ndyakutwara, iwe Zerubabeeli omwiru wangye, mwene Shealutieli, nkugire empeta y'akamanyiso; ahabw'okuba nkutooraine; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>